# Build output. Eleventy writes _site/, Lightning CSS writes the two sheets
# inside it. index.html, styles.css and home.css are listed because bin/build
# used to write them into the repo root and commit them; nothing generates them
# there any more, and a stray copy would shadow the real page in Eleventy's
# input directory.
_site/
/index.html
/styles.css
/home.css

# Throwaway QA artifacts (screenshots, PoC output)
scratch/
hero-*
node_modules/
